node_modules/
# ⛔⛔ NO TRAILING SLASH. `test/node_modules/` matches a DIRECTORY only, and the
# test harness links node_modules in from a sibling checkout, so git saw a
# SYMLINK (mode 120000), `git add -A` committed it, and GitHub Pages died:
# upload-pages-artifact runs `tar --dereference`, the link dangles on the
# runner, tar exits 1 and the WHOLE SITE stops deploying. The push succeeded,
# the workflow failed, and the live URL kept serving the old build.
test/node_modules
test/shots/
test/*.jpg
test/package-lock.json
*.log
.DS_Store
